s of a map they discover on her desk, it seems Mui has again gone off to try to get back her older brother Tsuganashi.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v1gIeFtwUzUn7z2Y64mp4FQirqg.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9995","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"19769","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"19769","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"72091","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275574","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"18026","synopsis":"Based on their performance during the school-wide Ancestral Magic exam, Takeshi and friends may be allowed to participate in the operation to recover Mui's brother Tsuganashi. The exam is split into separate levels where each of the different types of Ancestral Magic is tested separately.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/PaBC7rRK8erjOFZvOwD3on65Js.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Based on their performance during the school-wide Ancestral Magic exam, Takeshi and friends may be allowed to participate in the operation to recover Mui's brother Tsuganashi. The exam is split into separate levels where each of the different types of Ancestral Magic is tested separately.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/PaBC7rRK8erjOFZvOwD3on65Js.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9995","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"19769","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"19769","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"72091","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275574","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"18029","synopsis":"Based on their superior performance during the Ancestral Magic exam, Takeshi and his friends are allowed to participate in the operation to recover Tsuganashi as they were promised. The School Director, Momoka, takes them with her to battle, where she faces Washizu while Takeshi's group faces Tsuganashi. However, Mui's indomitable desire to save her brother at any cost causes her to take extreme actions...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rxj10EYdOPc9UtKPxkGxOLn3xUV.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Based on their superior performance during the Ancestral Magic exam, Takeshi and his friends are allowed to participate in the operation to recover Tsuganashi as they were promised. The School Director, Momoka, takes them with her to battle, where she faces Washizu while Takeshi's group faces Tsuganashi. However, Mui's indomitable desire to save her brother at any cost causes her to take extreme actions...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rxj10EYdOPc9UtKPxkGxOLn3xUV.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9995","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"19769","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"19769","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"72091","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275574","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"18036","synopsis":"Takeshi has been having nightmares nearly every night. One day, he is overcome by a sudden lightheadedness and collapses. According to Nanami, the cause is severe fatigue and lack of sleep. While Takeshi rests in the Nurses's Office, an odd phenomenon warps the space around him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/54Jbr5tG4y3KplMj8EcwOLRU6eK.